      "textCN": "是的，我喜欢。"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "Do you want a cup?",
      "textCN": "你想要一杯吗？"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "Yes, please.",
      "textCN": "是的，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "Do you want any sugar? ",
      "textCN": "你要放糖吗？"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "Yes, please.",
      "textCN": "是的，请放点。"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "Do you want any milk? ",
      "textCN": "你要放牛奶吗？"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "No, thank you",
      "textCN": "不，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "Do you like cookies? ",
      "textCN": "你喜欢饼干吗？"
    },
    {
      "textEN": "Yes, I do. Do you want one?",
      "textCN": "是的。你要来一块吗？"
    }
  ]
